Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:02:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 40/47] metal: GPU peak finder for multiscale CLEAN
 (mx_peak_find)

Masked, bordered, negative-capable argmax over an image stack, one
threadgroup per scale. Verified bit-identical to a CPU reference on six
configurations up to 3072x3072 with masks and borders (mx-peak-probe).

Two bugs found and fixed while validating: MSL packs {float,uint,uint} to
12 bytes so the host 16-byte stride read the wrong record, and reading the
uint index fields through float* truncates them to 0.

